    "Scan of the 1946 edition of the Tuckasegee, North Carolina, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the Tennessee Valley Authority. Aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1946; photo inspected in 1987; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1989.",
